{
  "$comment": "Icon catalog from Figma \"Foundation – UI 2\", Iconography (node 12:3948): categories and groups as laid out in Figma, icon names as Iconoir names. `figmaNames` lists Figma layers whose name differs from Iconoir's (typos or older Iconoir names). `npm run tokens` builds public/icons/iconoir.svg (a sprite of just these icons) and the Icons section of public/llms.txt from this file.",
  "library": {
    "name": "Iconoir",
    "package": "iconoir",
    "url": "https://iconoir.com",
    "license": "MIT",
    "style": "regular"
  },
  "intro": "The bulk of our icons are contained within a 24px frame, using 1px strokes with rounded caps, and can optionally come in a “small” size geared towards a 12px bounding box.",
  "sizes": [
    {
      "size": 32,
      "usage": "Large, standalone moments: empty states, onboarding, feature highlights."
    },
    {
      "size": 24,
      "usage": "Default. Standalone icons in navigation, toolbars and cards."
    },
    {
      "size": 20,
      "usage": "List rows and menus next to body-large text."
    },
    {
      "size": 16,
      "usage": "Inside Buttons and Icon Buttons, inputs and dense UI next to body-medium text."
    },
    {
      "size": 12,
      "usage": "The “small” size: badges, tags and inline with body-small text."
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    "Inline the sprite (public/icons/iconoir.svg) once per page — at the top of <body>, or fetch and insert it like src/lib/icon.ts does — then use the Icon Shell: <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-<name>\"></use></svg>. Set the size with icon--32, icon--24 (default), icon--20, icon--16 or icon--12.",
    "Only use icons from this catalog. To add one, add it in Figma and to tokens/icons.json, then run npm run tokens.",
    "Icons take the current text color; set it with a --color-icon-* token on the icon or its parent, never a hex value.",
    "Decorative icons get aria-hidden=\"true\". An icon that is the only content of a control needs an aria-label on the control (see Icon Button).",
    "Buttons and Icon Buttons size their icons to 16px automatically."
  ],
